        {
          "text": " Kosodi Boas alosit orute, kiboikin nina; ido koany, kotubor ekalakunan ŋol loabu Boas kolimite; kotema ŋesi ŋol ebe, “Ŋo ba loce! Kopau ber kiboikin ne.” Kopaa kiboikin, ",
