            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Apotu aŋor aidunyetake konerokis ekiror kineras ebe, “Aurikin Naomi ikoku yenisapat.” Komaikis ekekiror Obed: ŋol ŋes papa loka Yese, papa loka Daudi,",
          "type": "text",
